{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04937","headline":"仪坤庙乐章二首 一 · 薛稷","name":"仪坤庙乐章二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳灵配德，阴魄昭升。\n尧坛凤下，汉室龙兴。\n俔天作对，前旒是凝。\n化行南国，道盛西陵。\n造舟集灌，无德而称。\n我粢既洁，我醴既澄。\n阴阴灵庙，光灵若凭。\n德馨惟飨，孝思烝烝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}